old = '''Build260 / 0.14.93 exact source `b9a5de5255650f04e312e117f47453122de56adc`, Draft PR #268, directly extends Build259 with diagnostic-only per-display-frame sampling of real `UIScrollView.contentOffset.y` during native deceleration. It preserves the same single cadence display link and high-refresh request, and records zero-move frames, zero→catch-up pairs, reversals, movement-step distributions and consecutive step-ratio distributions. It does not change `decelerationRate`, ScrollView physics, Grid layout, pagination, images/caches, Search, Home carousel, Player or Transport. Xcode 16.4 run/job `33307963917 / 99247767453` succeeded; artifact `9731113592`, digest `sha256:293055cff1d8524a19ac4e21b39bb2b90afc7451fb1311c4760efc53d08739f8`; IPA SHA `1434d2b31c7ced4f344b2e946c5311d2c287774cfe72bbcbd527a24a1ccbffe8`; source ZIP SHA `875ea8a22e4aca0924c58e70faf250a891a8b97ce980a300bc6bcf1ee16998db`; MinOS 15.0. Evidence: Code/CI/IPA verified; target-device pending; no fix/stable claim.'''
new = old.replace('Draft PR #268', 'superseded Draft PR #268').replace('target-device pending', 'target-device diagnostic completed') + '''\n\nBuild261 / 0.14.94 exact source `e552bebd072a915e6cb10d591d704a5a3c342406`, Draft PR #270, directly extends Build260. Home reuses the existing real vertical `UIScrollView` observer and requests 80→device-max only during drag/deceleration; target-device logs now show Home display p50/p95 8.34 ms in all 12 captured sessions and the user reports it is noticeably better, although max 50.31/36.24/76.94 ms tails remain. Library adds same-frame long-gap attribution: 49 sessions / 9,573 display samples contain 356 `>=12.5 ms`, 94 `>=25 ms`, 57 `>=33.3 ms` gaps. One fixed 600→600 fast-scroll session has 73 long gaps with 67 overlapping cell churn, proving cell lifecycle work is a direct contributor; fixed-count sessions still reach 112.97 ms and 162 total long gaps are untracked, proving a second source. Build261 is Code/CI/IPA/real-device tested but not stable. Do not treat 120 Hz request, pagination optimization, physics tuning or a wholesale Grid replacement as a complete solution without isolating the severe untracked tail.'''
assert old in text, 'project state Build260 paragraph not found'
text = text.replace(old, new, 1)
project.write_text(text)

